</div>

<!-- NAV -->
<nav>
  <div class="nav-inner">
    <a href="index.html" class="nav-logo">Cosplay Couture</a>
    <ul class="nav-links">
      <li><a href="{{ path('app_home') }}">Home</a></li>
      <li><a href="{{ path('app_home') }}#categories">Shop</a></li>
      <li><a href="{{ path('app_about') }}">About</a></li>
      <li><a href="{{ path('app_contact') }}">Contact</a></li>
    </ul>
    <div style="display:flex; align-items:center; gap:0.5rem;">
      <button class="hamburger" id="hamburger"><span></span><span></span><span></span></button>
      <a href="{{ path('app_login') }}" class="btn-outline" style="padding:0.52rem 1.25rem; font-size:0.85rem;">Log in</a>
      <a href="contact.html" class="btn-teal" style="padding:0.55rem 1.25rem; font-size:0.85rem;">Order Now</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</nav>

<!-- PAGE HEADER -->
<div class="page-header">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="teal-tag">✦ Our Story</div>
    <h1 class="brand fade-up" style="font-size:clamp(2.5rem,5vw,4rem); font-weight:700; line-height:1.1; margin-bottom:1rem;">
      Crafted with passion,<br /><em style="color:var(--teal);">worn with pride</em>
    </h1>
    <p class="fade-up" style="color:rgba(15,26,35,0.6); font-size:1.125rem; max-width:520px; line-height:1.8; text-align:center;">
      We're a small studio of dedicated cosplayers and artisans who turned a shared obsession into a craft. Every costume we make carries a piece of us.
    </p>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- ① STORY -->
<section id="story">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="story-grid">
      <div>
        <div class="teal-tag">✦ How It Began</div>
        <h2 class="brand fade-up" style="font-size:clamp(1.75rem,3.5vw,2.5rem); font-weight:700; line-height:1.2; margin-bottom:1.25rem;">
          From a bedroom workshop to the convention stage
        </h2>
        <div style="display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:1rem; color:rgba(15,26,35,0.68); font-size:0.9875rem; line-height:1.8;" class="fade-up">
          <p>It started in 2019 when our founder, Sofia Reyes, couldn't find a costume that fit her vision — or her measurements. Armed with a sewing machine, a pile of reference images, and a lot of determination, she made her first costume for AniManila.</p>
          <p>The costume won Best in Cosplay. Her inbox never recovered.</p>
          <p>By 2021, Sofia had assembled a small team of fellow cosplayers-turned-craftspeople, and Cosplay Couture officially opened its doors. Today we serve cosplayers across the Philippines and beyond — still handmaking every single order with the same obsessive attention to detail that started it all.</p>
        </div>
        <div style="margin-top:2rem;" class="fade-up">
          <a href="contact.html" class="btn-teal">Start Your Order</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="story-visual panel fade-up">
        <div class="story-badge">
          <div class="big">800+</div>
          <div class="sm">Costumes Delivered</div>
        </div>
        <div class="story-year">2019</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ② VALUES -->
<section id="values" style="background: rgba(255,255,255,0.22); backdrop-filter:blur(6px);">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="teal-tag">✦ What We Stand For</div>
    <h2 class="brand" style="font-size:clamp(1.75rem,3.5vw,2.5rem); font-weight:700; line-height:1.2; max-width:500px;">
      Our values shape every stitch we make
    </h2>

    <div class="values-grid">
      <div class="value-card card-surface fade-up">
        <div class="value-icon">🎯</div>
        <h3>Accuracy First</h3>
        <p>We study reference material obsessively. Our goal is for every costume to be instantly recognizable — to cosplayers and casual fans alike.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="value-card card-surface fade-up">
        <div class="value-icon">🤝</div>
        <h3>Real Collaboration</h3>
        <p>You're not just a client, you're a co-creator. We keep communication open throughout the entire process and welcome every input.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="value-card card-surface fade-up">
        <div class="value-icon">✂️</div>
        <h3>Craft Over Speed</h3>
        <p>We take the time each costume deserves. Rushed work shows — so we never rush. Our timelines reflect the effort, not impatience.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="value-card card-surface fade-up">
        <div class="value-icon">📐</div>
        <h3>Made For Your Body</h3>
        <p>Every costume is patterned to your measurements. No alterations, no pins — it fits because we made it for you.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="value-card card-surface fade-up">
        <div class="value-icon">♻️</div>
        <h3>Responsible Materials</h3>
        <p>We source quality, durable fabrics and aim to minimize waste. Good craft should be good for the planet too.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="value-card card-surface fade-up">
        <div class="value-icon">🌟</div>
        <h3>Community Roots</h3>
        <p>We grew up in the cosplay community. We sponsor local cons, support emerging cosplayers, and give back whenever we can.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ③ MEET THE TEAM -->
<section id="team">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="teal-tag">✦ Meet the Team</div>
    <h2 class="brand" style="font-size:clamp(1.75rem,3.5vw,2.5rem); font-weight:700; line-height:1.2; margin-bottom:0.5rem;">
      The hands behind<br /><em style="color:var(--teal);">every costume</em>
    </h2>
    <p style="color:rgba(15,26,35,0.6); font-size:1rem; max-width:480px; line-height:1.8;">A small but mighty crew of makers, dreamers, and dedicated fans.</p>

    <div class="team-grid">
      <!-- Sofia -->
      <div class="team-card card-surface fade-up">
        <div class="team-avatar-wrap" style="background: linear-gradient(145deg, rgba(42,157,143,0.25), rgba(42,157,143,0.08));">
          <div class="team-initials" style="color:rgba(31,122,112,0.5);">SR</div>
          <div style="position:absolute; inset:0; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-size:4rem; opacity:0.18;">✦</div>
        </div>
        <div class="team-body">
          <div class="team-name">Sofia Reyes</div>
          <div class="team-role">Founder & Lead Designer</div>
          <p class="team-bio">The visionary behind Cosplay Couture. Sofia handles concept approval, complex builds, and mentors every new team member.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <!-- Marco -->
      <div class="team-card card-surface fade-up">
        <div class="team-avatar-wrap" style="background: linear-gradient(145deg, rgba(197,143,58,0.22), rgba(197,143,58,0.07));">
          <div class="team-initials" style="color:rgba(158,114,46,0.5);">MC</div>
          <div style="position:absolute; inset:0; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-size:4rem; opacity:0.15;">⚙️</div>
        </div>
        <div class="team-body">
          <div class="team-name">Marco Cruz</div>
          <div class="team-role">Armor & Props Specialist</div>
          <p class="team-bio">Marco crafts every piece of armor and weaponry. His EVA foam techniques are the stuff of convention legend.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <!-- Anika -->
      <div class="team-card card-surface fade-up">
        <div class="team-avatar-wrap" style="background: linear-gradient(145deg, rgba(180,93,92,0.2), rgba(180,93,92,0.06));">
          <div class="team-initials" style="color:rgba(144,74,74,0.5);">AL</div>
          <div style="position:absolute; inset:0; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-size:4rem; opacity:0.15;">✂️</div>
        </div>
        <div class="team-body">
          <div class="team-name">Anika Lim</div>
          <div class="team-role">Senior Seamstress</div>
          <p class="team-bio">Ten years of tailoring experience makes Anika our go-to for intricate garments, delicate fabrics, and impossible requests.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <!-- Diego -->
      <div class="team-card card-surface fade-up">
        <div class="team-avatar-wrap" style="background: linear-gradient(145deg, rgba(42,157,143,0.15), rgba(197,143,58,0.1));">
          <div class="team-initials" style="color:rgba(42,100,90,0.4);">DT</div>
          <div style="position:absolute; inset:0; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-size:4rem; opacity:0.12;">🎨</div>
        </div>
        <div class="team-body">
          <div class="team-name">Diego Torres</div>
          <div class="team-role">Painter & Finisher</div>
          <p class="team-bio">Diego's hand-painted details and weathering effects are what elevate our costumes from good to jaw-dropping.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <!-- Jess -->
      <div class="team-card card-surface fade-up">
        <div class="team-avatar-wrap" style="background: linear-gradient(145deg, rgba(197,143,58,0.18), rgba(180,93,92,0.1));">
          <div class="team-initials" style="color:rgba(140,100,40,0.4);">JR</div>
          <div style="position:absolute; inset:0; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-size:4rem; opacity:0.13;">💡</div>
        </div>
        <div class="team-body">
          <div class="team-name">Jessica Ramos</div>
          <div class="team-role">Client Relations & Orders</div>
          <p class="team-bio">Jessica is your first point of contact — she handles quotes, measurements, scheduling, and making sure everyone's smiling.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <!-- Kyle -->
      <div class="team-card card-surface fade-up">
        <div class="team-avatar-wrap" style="background: linear-gradient(145deg, rgba(15,26,35,0.12), rgba(42,157,143,0.08));">
          <div class="team-initials" style="color:rgba(15,26,35,0.3);">KS</div>
          <div style="position:absolute; inset:0; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-size:4rem; opacity:0.1;">📦</div>
        </div>
        <div class="team-body">
          <div class="team-name">Kyle Santos</div>
          <div class="team-role">Logistics & Shipping</div>
          <p class="team-bio">Kyle ensures every costume arrives safely, on time, and packed with enough care to survive even international shipping.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ④ MILESTONES -->
<section id="milestones" style="background: rgba(255,255,255,0.22); backdrop-filter:blur(6px);">
  <div class="container">
    <div style="display:grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap:5rem; align-items:start;">
      <div>
        <div class="teal-tag">✦ Our Journey</div>
        <h2 class="brand" style="font-size:clamp(1.75rem,3.5vw,2.5rem); font-weight:700; line-height:1.2;">
          Five years of making <em style="color:var(--teal);">unforgettable</em> moments
        </h2>
      </div>
      <div class="timeline">
        <div class="timeline-item fade-up">
          <div class="timeline-year">2019</div>
          <div class="timeline-content">
